{"id":"d8467271be865fd7","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-cor-elementary.md","title":"Elementary Substructure Corollary","display":"cor-elementary — Elementary Substructure Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-elementary","aliases":["58-cor-elementary"],"display":"cor-elementary — Elementary Substructure Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-thm-loewenheim-skolem.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-elementary.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-elementary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-elementary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-elementary — Elementary Substructure Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"33fad5560e7fe384\" href=\"?note=33fad5560e7fe384\" title=\"../batch12/58-thm-loewenheim-skolem.md\">../batch12/58-thm-loewenheim-skolem.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md\">../batch09/58-df-elementary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,\\mathfrak A,A\\in V\\land|\\mathcal L|\\leq\\aleph_0\">\\(\\mathcal L,\\mathfrak A,A\\in V\\land|\\mathcal L|\\leq\\aleph_0\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2\\land\\operatorname{Univ}:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2\\land\\operatorname{Univ}:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (structure predicate and universe projection, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (elementary-substructure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md\">../batch09/58-df-elementary.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)=A\\land|A|\\geq\\aleph_0\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)=A\\land|A|\\geq\\aleph_0\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}elementary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)=A\n\\land |A|\\geq\\aleph_0\n\\land |\\mathcal L|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\exists B\\;\n\\bigl(\nB\\subseteq A\n\\land |B|=\\aleph_0\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak B)=B\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}elementary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)=A\n\\land |A|\\geq\\aleph_0\n\\land |\\mathcal L|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\exists B\\;\n\\bigl(\nB\\subseteq A\n\\land |B|=\\aleph_0\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak B)=B\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every infinite structure in a countable language has a countable elementary substructure.</li>\n<li>This follows from the downward Löwenheim-Skolem theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-thm-loewenheim-skolem.md","status":"resolved","id":"33fad5560e7fe384","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-thm-loewenheim-skolem.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md","status":"resolved","id":"e91c1261e1c2374b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-elementary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2\\land\\operatorname{Univ}:V\\rightharpoonup V$ (structure predicate and universe projection, see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"tar